        "NC_GLOBAL": {
          "featureType": "timeSeries",
          "title": "FRF 11m AWAC Currents",
          "station_name": "11m-AWAC",
          "summary": "USACE/COAB data collected by a bottom mounted (looking up) Nortek AWAC, approximately 1150m offshore of Duck (FRF), NC \n  at a nominal depth of -11m NAVD 88.  Directional current profiles were interpolated to 0.5m intervals relative to \n  NAVD88, and depth integrated currents are computed.  Data values start closest to the gauge and go upwards.\n  This instrument is hard-wired to a shore-based data acquisition system and analyzed on one or two hour intervals.  \n  Directions are flowing towards clockwise fron true north (0 degrees is flowing towards true north, 90 degrees to the east). \n  These data have been processed and QC checked with an automated analysis progran and should be considered preliminary.\n",
