          "title": "FRF NOAA Tide Station",
          "summary": "USACE/CHL/COAB downloads NOAA preliminary tide data at 30 minute intervals from the FRF \n  end-of-pier (EOP) NOAA station (8651370).  These data have not undergone NOAA quality checks.\n  For the Link to the NOAA site for this station, and quality controlled archive data use\n  http://tidesandcurrents.noaa.gov/noaatidepredictions/NOAATidesFacade.jsp?Stationid=8651370.\n  An dataSource variable (1-byte) identifies what gauge was used to fill times when the NOAA gauge \n  was not operational.  The following values indicate the data source -\n    0 = missing value\n    1 = NOAA QC archive data\n    2 = NOAA preliminary data (realtime data)\n    3 = FRF EOP Paros Pressure gauge, ID=1861\n    4 = FRF 8m Array median pressure gauge\n    5 = Other FRF gauge\n",
